  "description": "The 4th of July is the national holiday of the United States, commemorating the adoption of the Declaration of Independence in 1776. It is a day of patriotic celebration, including parades, fireworks, barbecues, and wearing red, white, and blue attire. The meme references this specific holiday to frame the celebration as inherently 'American' and to contrast it with the implied racial insensitivity of the text.",
